{"ref":"BDB, תִּמְנָע","hw":"תִּמְנָע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תִּמְנָע</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> and <strong>f.</strong> Edomite name. 𝔊 Θαμνα:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּמְנָע</span> <strong>n.pr.m. </strong> <strong>a.</strong>  a chief of Edom <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:40\" href=\"/Genesis.36.40\">Gn 36:40</a>=<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:51\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.51\">1 Ch 1:51</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  son of Eliphaz <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.36\">1 Ch 1:36</a> (for Korah <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:15\" href=\"/Genesis.36.15\">Gn 36:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:16\" href=\"/Genesis.36.16\">16</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּמְנָע֑</span> <strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:22\" href=\"/Genesis.36.22\">Gn 36:22</a>=<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.39\">1 Ch 1:39</a> sister of Lotan (of Seir); <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:12\" href=\"/Genesis.36.12\">Gn 36:12</a> concubine of Eliphaz son of Esau.","next":"BDB, מַנְעוּל","prev":"BDB, יִמְנָע"}